    "通过 USB 添加你选择的照片和视频，并在本机读回核验。不删除已有媒体，不通过网络传输。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adds your selected photos and videos over USB and verifies originals locally. Does not delete existing media or transfer over the network."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 USB 添加你选择的照片和视频，并在本机读回核验。不删除已有媒体，不通过网络传输。"
